1
00:00:00,930 --> 00:00:02,870
(Zack:)and Archie's married
to Betty in one

2
00:00:02,870 --> 00:00:03,930
(Zack:)and Veronica
in the other.

3
00:00:03,930 --> 00:00:06,240
(Zack:)Midge is even breaking
up with Moose.

4
00:00:06,240 --> 00:00:08,140
(Sheldon:)No.

5
00:00:08,140 --> 00:00:09,840
(Zack:)About time, right?

6
00:00:09,840 --> 00:00:11,340
(Leonard:)Hey.

7
00:00:11,340 --> 00:00:14,810
(Leonard:)Hey.
You guys finally chip in
for a bodyguard?

8
00:00:16,350 --> 00:00:17,880
(Leonard:)Uh, no. Oh,
this is Zack.

9
00:00:17,880 --> 00:00:19,280
(Leonard:)He's a friend
of ours.

10
00:00:19,280 --> 00:00:20,180
(Leonard:)Zack, this is Stuart.

11
00:00:20,180 --> 00:00:22,020
(Leonard:)He owns
the store.

12
00:00:22,020 --> 00:00:23,620
(Zack:)Wow, lucky you.

13
00:00:23,620 --> 00:00:26,360
(Stuart:)Yeah, I work
70 hours a week

14
00:00:26,360 --> 00:00:29,230
(Stuart:)and average
$1.65 an hour.

15
00:00:29,230 --> 00:00:31,560
(Zack:)Sweet.

16
00:00:32,430 --> 00:00:34,730
(Stuart:)Is that sarcasm?

17
00:00:34,730 --> 00:00:38,370
(Howard:)No, it's an indictment of the
American education system.

18
00:00:39,200 --> 00:00:41,140
The Archies are over here.

19
00:00:41,140 --> 00:00:43,090
(Zack:)Yippee.

20
00:00:44,680 --> 00:00:47,610
(Stuart:)So are you guys coming to
my New Year's Eve costume party?

21
00:00:47,610 --> 00:00:48,880
(Sheldon:)Of course.

22
00:00:48,880 --> 00:00:50,900
(Sheldon:)We're coming as the
Justice League of America.

23
00:00:50,900 --> 00:00:52,010
(Howard:)Switching it up from last year

24
00:00:52,020 --> 00:00:54,930
(Howard:)when we came as
the Justice League of America.

25
00:00:54,940 --> 00:00:56,190
(Sheldon:)To that point,

26
00:00:56,190 --> 00:00:59,960
(Sheldon:)it occurs to me that we
might have an opportunity

27
00:00:59,960 --> 00:01:02,460
(Sheldon:)to finally snare
Best Group Costume

